msgstr "terlalu dekat dengan area pengecualian, dan akan terjadi tabrakan.\n"

msgid ""
"Can not print multiple filaments which have large difference of temperature "
"together. Otherwise, the extruder and nozzle may be blocked or damaged "
"during printing"
msgstr "Tidak dapat mencetak beberapa filamen yang memiliki perbedaan suhu yang besar secara bersamaan. Jika tidak, ekstruder dan nosel mungkin tersumbat atau rusak selama pencetakan"

msgid "No extrusions under current settings."
msgstr "Tidak ada ekstrusi dengan pengaturan saat ini."

msgid ""
"Smooth mode of timelapse is not supported when \"by object\" sequence is "
"enabled."
msgstr "Mode halus dari jadwal tidak didukung ketika urutan \"oleh objek\" diaktifkan."

msgid ""
"Please select \"By object\" print sequence to print multiple objects in "
"spiral vase mode."
msgstr "Harap pilih urutan cetak \"Per objek\" untuk mencetak beberapa objek dalam mode spiral vase."


msgid ""
"The spiral vase mode does not work when an object contains more than one "
"materials."
msgstr "Mode vas spiral tidak berfungsi bila suatu benda mengandung lebih dari satu bahan."

#, boost-format
msgid "The object %1% exceeds the maximum build volume height."
msgstr "Objek %1% melebihi tinggi volume cetak maksimum."

#, boost-format
msgid ""
"While the object %1% itself fits the build volume, its last layer exceeds "
"the maximum build volume height."
msgstr "Meskipun objek %1% sendiri sesuai dengan volume pembuatan, lapisan terakhirnya melebihi tinggi volume pembuatan maksimum."

# generated by robot
msgid ""
"You might want to reduce the size of your model or change current print "
"settings and retry."
msgstr "Anda dapat memperkecil ukuran model atau mengubah pengaturan cetak saat ini lalu mencoba lagi."


msgid "Variable layer height is not supported with Organic supports."
msgstr "Tinggi lapisan variabel tidak didukung dengan support Organic."

# generated by robot
msgid "Overhang Optimization is not supported with Organic supports."
msgstr "Optimasi overhang tidak didukung dengan support Organic."

msgid ""
"Wipe towers with different specifications are an experimental feature. Use "
"with caution."
msgstr "Wipe tower dengan spesifikasi berbeda adalah fitur eksperimental. Gunakan dengan hati-hati."


msgid ""
"The Wipe Tower is currently only supported with the relative extruder "
"addressing (use_relative_e_distances=1)."
msgstr "Wipe Tower saat ini hanya didukung dengan pengalamatan ekstruder relatif (use_relative_e_distances=1)."


# generated by robot
msgid ""
"Ooze prevention is only supported with the wipe tower when "
"'single_extruder_multi_material' is off."
msgstr "Pencegahan cairan hanya didukung dengan wipe tower ketika 'single_extruder_multi_material' tidak aktif."

msgid ""
"The prime tower is currently only supported for the Marlin, RepRap/Sprinter, "
"RepRapFirmware and Repetier G-code flavors."
msgstr "Prime tower saat ini hanya mendukung varian G-code Marlin, RepRap/Sprinter, RepRapFirmware, dan Repetier."


msgid "The prime tower is not supported in \"By object\" print."
msgstr "Menara utama tidak didukung dalam cetakan \"Berdasarkan objek\"."

msgid ""
"The prime tower is not supported when adaptive layer height is on. It "
"requires that all objects have the same layer height."
msgstr "Menara utama tidak didukung ketika ketinggian lapisan adaptif aktif. Hal ini mengharuskan semua objek memiliki tinggi lapisan yang sama."

msgid "The prime tower requires \"support gap\" to be multiple of layer height"
msgstr "Menara utama memerlukan \"celah penyangga\" yang merupakan kelipatan tinggi lapisan"

msgid "The prime tower requires that all objects have the same layer heights"
msgstr "Menara utama mengharuskan semua objek memiliki ketinggian lapisan yang sama"

msgid ""
"The prime tower requires that all objects are printed over the same number "
"of raft layers"
msgstr "Menara utama mengharuskan semua objek dicetak pada jumlah lapisan rakit yang sama"

msgid ""
"The prime tower requires that all objects are sliced with the same layer "
"heights."
msgstr "Menara utama mengharuskan semua benda diiris dengan ketinggian lapisan yang sama."

msgid ""
"The prime tower is only supported if all objects have the same variable "
"layer height"
msgstr "Prime tower hanya didukung jika semua objek memiliki tinggi lapisan variabel yang sama"


msgid "Too small line width"
msgstr "Line width too small"

msgid "Too large line width"
msgstr "Line width too large"

msgid ""
"The prime tower requires that support has the same layer height with object."
msgstr "Menara utama mensyaratkan bahwa tumpuan memiliki ketinggian lapisan yang sama dengan benda."

# generated by robot
msgid ""
"Organic support tree tip diameter must not be smaller than support material "
"extrusion width."
msgstr "Diameter ujung pohon penyangga organik tidak boleh lebih kecil dari lebar ekstrusi bahan penyangga."

# generated by robot
msgid ""
"Organic support branch diameter must not be smaller than 2x support material "
"extrusion width."
msgstr "Diameter cabang penyangga organik tidak boleh lebih kecil dari 2x lebar ekstrusi bahan penyangga."

# generated by robot
msgid ""
"Organic support branch diameter must not be smaller than support tree tip "
"diameter."
msgstr "Diameter cabang support Organic tidak boleh lebih kecil dari diameter ujung tree support."


msgid ""
"Support enforcers are used but support is not enabled. Please enable support."
msgstr "Pemaksa penyangga digunakan tetapi penyangga belum diaktifkan. Harap aktifkan penyangga."


msgid ""
"This model contains painted support data. With organic supports, excessive "
"painted support data may slow support generation."
msgstr "Model ini berisi data penyangga yang dilukis. Dengan penyangga organik, data penyangga yang terlalu banyak dapat memperlambat pembuatan penyangga."


msgid "Layer height cannot exceed nozzle diameter"
msgstr "Tinggi lapisan tidak boleh melebihi diameter nozzle"

# generated by robot
msgid ""
"Relative extruder addressing requires resetting the extruder position at "
"each layer to prevent loss of floating point accuracy. Add \"G92 E0\" to "
"layer_gcode."
msgstr "Pengalamatan ekstruder relatif memerlukan pengaturan ulang posisi ekstruder di setiap lapisan untuk mencegah hilangnya akurasi floating point. Tambahkan \"G92 E0\" ke layer_gcode."

# generated by robot
msgid ""
"\"G92 E0\" was found in before_layer_gcode, which is incompatible with "
"absolute extruder addressing."
msgstr "\"G92 E0\" ditemukan di before_layer_gcode, yang tidak kompatibel dengan pengalamatan ekstruder absolut."


# generated by robot
msgid ""
"\"G92 E0\" was found in layer_gcode, which is incompatible with absolute "
"extruder addressing."
msgstr "\"G92 E0\" ditemukan di layer_gcode, yang tidak kompatibel dengan pengalamatan ekstruder absolut."


#, c-format, boost-format
msgid "Plate %d: %s does not support filament %s"
msgstr "Plate %d: %s tidak mendukung filamen %s"

#, c-format, boost-format
msgid "The flush multiplier setting is too low, value is %.2f"
msgstr "Pengaturan pengali flush terlalu rendah, nilainya %.2f"

msgid ""
"Setting the jerk speed too low could lead to artifacts on curved surfaces"
msgstr "Mengatur kecepatan jerk terlalu rendah dapat menyebabkan artefak pada permukaan melengkung"


msgid ""
"The jerk setting exceeds the printer's maximum jerk (machine_max_jerk_x/"
"machine_max_jerk_y).\n"
"CrealityPrint will automatically cap the jerk speed to ensure it doesn't "
"surpass the printer's capabilities.\n"
"You can adjust the maximum jerk setting in your printer's configuration to "
"get higher speeds."
msgstr "Pengaturan jerk melebihi jerk maksimum printer (machine_max_jerk_x/machine_max_jerk_y).\nCrealityPrint akan otomatis membatasi kecepatan jerk untuk memastikan tidak melampaui kemampuan printer.\nAnda dapat menyesuaikan pengaturan jerk maksimum di konfigurasi printer untuk mendapatkan kecepatan lebih tinggi."

msgid ""
"The acceleration setting exceeds the printer's maximum acceleration "
"(machine_max_acceleration_extruding).\n"
"CrealityPrint will automatically cap the acceleration speed to ensure it "
"doesn't surpass the printer's capabilities.\n"
"You can adjust the machine_max_acceleration_extruding value in your "
"printer's configuration to get higher speeds."
msgstr "Pengaturan akselerasi melebihi akselerasi maksimum printer (machine_max_acceleration_extruding).\nCrealityPrint akan otomatis membatasi akselerasi untuk memastikan tidak melampaui kemampuan printer.\nAnda dapat menyesuaikan nilai machine_max_acceleration_extruding di konfigurasi printer untuk mendapatkan kecepatan lebih tinggi."

msgid ""
"The travel acceleration setting exceeds the printer's maximum travel "
"acceleration (machine_max_acceleration_travel).\n"
"CrealityPrint will automatically cap the travel acceleration speed to ensure "
"it doesn't surpass the printer's capabilities.\n"
"You can adjust the machine_max_acceleration_travel value in your printer's "
"configuration to get higher speeds."
msgstr "Pengaturan akselerasi perpindahan melebihi akselerasi perpindahan maksimum printer (machine_max_acceleration_travel).\nCrealityPrint akan otomatis membatasi akselerasi perpindahan untuk memastikan tidak melampaui kemampuan printer.\nAnda dapat menyesuaikan nilai machine_max_acceleration_travel di konfigurasi printer untuk mendapatkan kecepatan lebih tinggi."

