# generated by robot
msgid "Precise wall"
msgstr "Dinding presisi"

# generated by robot
msgid ""
"Improve shell precision by adjusting outer wall spacing. This also improves "
"layer consistency.\n"
"Note: This setting will only take effect if the wall sequence is configured "
